<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>NovaX — Modern Website</title>

    <style>
        /* =========================
           BASIC RESET
        ========================== */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #0a0a0f;
            color: white;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        /* =========================
           NAVBAR
        ========================== */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }

        nav {
            max-width: 1150px;
            margin: auto;
            height: 70px;
            padding: 0 20px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #7c5cff;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: #ddd;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #8f75ff;
        }

        .menu-btn {
            display: none;
            font-size: 28px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* =========================
           HERO
        ========================== */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 140px 20px 80px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 350px;
            height: 350px;
            background: #6c4cff;
            filter: blur(140px);
            opacity: 0.35;
            top: 10%;
            left: 5%;
            animation: float 6s infinite alternate;
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            background: #00d9ff;
            filter: blur(130px);
            opacity: 0.25;
            bottom: 5%;
            right: 5%;
            animation: float 5s infinite alternate-reverse;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 850px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            animation: fadeUp 1s ease;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            border-radius: 30px;
            color: #b9adff;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 82px);
            line-height: 1.05;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .gradient-text {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8d70ff, #00d9ff);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: auto;
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            margin-top: 35px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 14px 25px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7455ff, #00bfff);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            border: 1px solid #444;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.03);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(100,80,255,0.3);
        }

        /* =========================
           SECTIONS
        ========================== */
        section {
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #999;
        }

        /* =========================
           CARDS
        ========================== */
        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(
                145deg,
                rgba(255,255,255,0.08),
                rgba(255,255,255,0.025)
            );

            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            transition: 0.4s;

            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(40px);
        }

        .card.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: rgba(125,95,255,0.5);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .icon {
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            background: rgba(124,92,255,0.15);
            font-size: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #999;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* =========================
           STATS
        ========================== */
        .stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat {
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        }

        .stat h3 {
            font-size: 35px;
            color: #8d75ff;
        }

        .stat p {
            color: #999;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        /* =========================
           CTA
        ========================== */
        .cta {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 70px 30px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-align: center;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    rgba(110,80,255,0.25),
                    rgba(0,200,255,0.12)
                );

            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .cta h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .cta p {
            color: #aaa;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        /* =========================
           FOOTER
        ========================== */
        footer {
            padding: 40px 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            text-align: center;
            color: #777;
        }

        /* =========================
           ANIMATIONS
        ========================== */
        @keyframes fadeUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(40px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes float {
            from {
                transform: translate(0, 0);
            }

            to {
                transform: translate(40px, -30px);
            }
        }

        /* =========================
           MOBILE
        ========================== */
        @media (max-width: 800px) {

            .menu-btn {
                display: block;
            }

            .nav-links {
                position: absolute;
                top: 70px;
                left: 0;
                width: 100%;

                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 20px;

                padding: 25px;
                background: #111119;

                display: none;
            }

            .nav-links.active {
                display: flex;
                animation: fadeUp 0.3s ease;
            }

            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .stats {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .hero {
                padding-top: 130px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .section-title h2 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }

            .cta h2 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 450px) {

            .stats {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .hero-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .btn {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- =========================
         NAVBAR
    ========================== -->

    <header>
        <nav>

            <div class="logo">NovaX</div>

            <div class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn">
                ☰
            </div>

            <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
                <li><a href="#stats">Stats</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>

        </nav>
    </header>


    <!-- =========================
         HERO
    ========================== -->

    <section class="hero" id="home">

        <div class="hero-content">

            <span class="badge">
                ✨ Modern Digital Experience
            </span>

            <h1>
                Build Something
                <span class="gradient-text">
                    Amazing
                </span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                A modern, responsive and animated website template
                created using only HTML, CSS and JavaScript.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-buttons">

                <a href="#features" class="btn btn-primary">
                    Explore Features
                </a>

                <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">
                    Get Started
                </a>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================
         FEATURES
    ========================== -->

    <section id="features">

        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">

                <h2>Powerful Features</h2>

                <p>
                    Everything you need for a modern website.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="cards">

                <div class="card reveal">

                    <div class="icon">
                        ⚡
                    </div>

                    <h3>Fast Performance</h3>

                    <p>
                        Lightweight code and optimized animations
                        provide a smooth browsing experience.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="card reveal">

                    <div class="icon">
                        📱
                    </div>

                    <h3>Fully Responsive</h3>

                    <p>
                        Looks great on phones, tablets, laptops
                        and desktop screens.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="card reveal">

                    <div class="icon">
                        🎨
                    </div>

                    <h3>Modern Design</h3>

                    <p>
                        Clean layouts, glass effects and beautiful
                        gradients create a premium appearance.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="card reveal">

                    <div class="icon">
                        🔒
                    </div>

                    <h3>Simple & Secure</h3>

                    <p>
                        No unnecessary libraries. Everything is
                        contained inside one HTML file.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="card reveal">

                    <div class="icon">
                        🚀
                    </div>

                    <h3>Easy to Customize</h3>

                    <p>
                        Change colors, text, cards and sections
                        according to your project.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="card reveal">

                    <div class="icon">
                        💡
                    </div>

                    <h3>Beginner Friendly</h3>

                    <p>
                        Simple HTML, CSS and JavaScript that is
